1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,703
Two.

2
00:00:00,703 --> 00:00:09,622
A free hydrogen ion is just a bare proton, about ten to the minus fifteen metres across, with an enormous charge density.

3
00:00:09,622 --> 00:00:12,018
It cannot float around alone.

4
00:00:12,018 --> 00:00:19,804
In water, it is grabbed at once by a water molecule, forming the hydronium ion, H three O plus.

